### StudyPilot 学习计划 Agent 本地闭环
### 使用方式：先启动 Java 8080 和 Python 8000，再在 IDEA 中从上到下逐条运行。

@javaHost = http://localhost:8080
@aiHost = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@internalToken = local-dev-internal-token

### 1. 注册测试用户，并保存 Java Token 与用户 ID
POST {{javaHost}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent-demo-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "StudyPilot123!",
  "displayName": "Agent 联调用户"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
  client.global.set("ownerId", response.body.user.id);
%}

### 2. 创建学习目标，并保存目标 ID
POST {{javaHost}}/api/learning-goals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "在年底前掌握 Java 与 AI 智能应用开发",
  "targetDate": "2026-12-31",
  "weeklyStudyHours": 10
}

> {%
  client.global.set("goalId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. 创建 Python Agent 会话
POST {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "{{ownerId}}",
  "goalId": "{{goalId}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.conversationId);
%}

### 4. 第一轮：描述目标和基础
# @timeout 5 m
POST {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我会 Java 基础语法，Spring Boot 刚起步，希望先做出能运行的项目闭环。"
}

### 5. 第二轮：补充时间与计划偏好
# @timeout 5 m
POST {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我每周能学习 10 小时，工作日每天 1 小时，周末可以多安排编程实践。"
}

### 6. 如仍为 COLLECTING，继续回答 Agent 的问题；如为 DRAFT_READY，可提出修改
# @timeout 5 m
POST {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请把手动编程任务比例逐步提高，单个任务尽量控制在 30 到 90 分钟。"
}

### 7. 不调用模型，读取当前会话快照
GET {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations/{{conversationId}}
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}

### 8. 仅当状态为 DRAFT_READY 时执行显式确认
POST {{aiHost}}/internal/agent/conversations/{{conversationId}}/confirm
X-Internal-Service-Token: {{internalToken}}

### 9. 从 Java 查询最终计划
GET {{javaHost}}/api/learning-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. 从 Java 查询最终任务
GET {{javaHost}}/api/learning-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. 查询 Agent 执行记录
GET {{javaHost}}/api/agent-executions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. 查询确认与状态变更审计
GET {{javaHost}}/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
